258
00:17:18,140 --> 00:17:20,437
In other words there's a
good reason why your friend

259
00:17:20,520 --> 00:17:24,240
did what she did But before
I go into the details,

260
00:17:24,420 --> 00:17:27,517
I want you to understand that both
Nico Robin and I have the means to

261
00:17:27,600 --> 00:17:31,835
revive an ancient weapon that is
capable of destroying the entire world.

262
00:17:32,480 --> 00:17:34,720
A weapon? That's right.

263
00:17:38,520 --> 00:17:39,440
It's me.

264
00:17:39,760 --> 00:17:41,466
We've hit a snag in the plan.

265
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:44,812
Everyone head to the bedroom immediately.

266
00:17:45,620 --> 00:17:47,400
Don't shoot Iceberg yet.

267
00:17:49,020 --> 00:17:51,300
Do you understand now?

268
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:54,680
The blueprints that they found are fake.

269
00:17:57,020 --> 00:17:58,100
I don't care.

270
00:17:58,440 --> 00:18:02,097
I would rather die than hand over
that information to the government.

271
00:18:02,180 --> 00:18:03,886
But now it's not that simple.

272
00:18:04,020 --> 00:18:06,177
If you've decided that
you're going to help them,

273
00:18:06,260 --> 00:18:08,617
and you're searching for
the Poneglyphs yourself,

274
00:18:08,700 --> 00:18:11,520
then I have to do everything
I can to stop you!

275
00:18:12,800 --> 00:18:14,597
I understand your concern,

276
00:18:14,680 --> 00:18:18,817
but I'm only studying the Poneglyphs to
learn more about the history of the world.

277
00:18:18,900 --> 00:18:20,680
I don't care about the weapon.

278
00:18:21,600 --> 00:18:23,620
You have to take responsibility!

279
00:18:26,040 --> 00:18:30,560
I told you this would
happen, but you don't listen.

280
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:37,480
Franky, even if you weren't trying
to, weapons are made to hurt people.

281
00:18:37,840 --> 00:18:41,920
Whether you want them to or
not, they can hurt your friends.

282
00:18:43,040 --> 00:18:47,597
Even if you don't have malicious intent,
your actions can still hurt people.

283
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:51,537
If your curiosity for history leads
to the destruction of the world,

284
00:18:51,620 --> 00:18:54,796
then you're better off dying
right here and right now,

285
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:55,750
Nico Robin!

286
00:18:57,480 --> 00:19:00,317
Even after seeing what happened
to the devils of Ohara,

287
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:02,360
you still want to walk this path?

288
00:19:03,460 --> 00:19:05,980
You don't know a damn thing about Ohara!

289
00:19:06,640 --> 00:19:10,540
You have no idea how much the world
government has warped my life.

290
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:11,680
Do you hear me?

291
00:19:12,580 --> 00:19:16,260
If you hate the government
so much, then why help them?

292
00:19:19,400 --> 00:19:22,812
Because I have a wish that I
would sacrifice anything for.

293
00:19:29,760 --> 00:19:33,620
When I came to this town, CP9
presented me with two conditions.

294
00:19:34,080 --> 00:19:38,820
The first was to pin your assassination
on the Straw Hats and leave their crew.

295
00:19:39,780 --> 00:19:42,937
The second was to turn
myself over to the government

296
00:19:43,020 --> 00:19:45,726
and follow their every
order without question.

297
00:19:46,300 --> 00:19:48,418
You realize they won't let you live.

298
00:19:48,720 --> 00:19:50,800
You escaped them for 20 years.

299
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:53,845
Why would you agree to
something like that now?

300
00:19:54,640 --> 00:19:56,520
In this particular instance,

301
00:19:57,140 --> 00:20:02,240
Cape has been given permission to activate
a Buster Call against the Straw Hats.

302
00:20:02,480 --> 00:20:03,720
A Buster Call?

303
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:07,457
It's an emergency order
that summons five Vice

304
00:20:07,540 --> 00:20:10,540
-Admirals and ten battleships
to the same location.

305
00:20:12,080 --> 00:20:15,557
no matter how strong you
are no one can survive

306
00:20:15,640 --> 00:20:18,228
a full-scale military
attack of that caliber

307
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:23,097
under normal circumstances only the
three admirals and the head of the

308
00:20:23,180 --> 00:20:26,857
navy the fleet admiral are allowed
to exercise that kind of authority

309
00:20:26,940 --> 00:20:33,837
however this is a special case just
this once admiral aokiji has given

310
00:20:33,920 --> 00:20:38,580
cp9 the right to make the call when
i heard his name i surrendered.

311
00:20:38,840 --> 00:20:40,537
If I hadn't agreed to their conditions,

312
00:20:40,620 --> 00:20:43,917
then me and the rest of the straw
hats would have been annihilated.

313
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:48,765
For the past 20 years, I've been able to
run away and survive, no matter what the

314
00:20:49,880 --> 00:20:50,710
circumstance.

315
00:20:50,793 --> 00:20:52,877
That's only because I
had nothing to protect.

316
00:20:52,960 --> 00:20:56,397
Because I was willing to betray
others and use them as a shield.

317
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:57,560
But not now.

318
00:20:57,860 --> 00:21:01,340
For the first time in all
these years, I can't do that.

319
00:21:03,500 --> 00:21:06,300
But, they picked up the life I gave up on,

320
00:21:06,720 --> 00:21:12,740
returned the heart I lost, and continued
the dreams that I no longer believed in.

321
00:21:13,680 --> 00:21:19,400
Even after all I've done, I've found
friends who will still believe in me.

322
00:21:20,180 --> 00:21:21,080
I see.

323
00:21:21,420 --> 00:21:23,180
But then what is your wish?

324
00:21:26,220 --> 00:21:28,997
That excluding me all
of the other Straw Hat

325
00:21:29,080 --> 00:21:30,897
pirates will be allowed
to leave this island.

326
00:21:30,980 --> 00:21:36,757
Safely and as long as
you have that you don't

327
00:21:36,840 --> 00:21:39,369
care what happens to
the rest of the world?

328
00:21:39,940 --> 00:21:43,920
I don't I've heard all that I can take!

329
00:21:51,220 --> 00:21:54,180
In the end I couldn't pull the trigger.

330
00:22:00,980 --> 00:22:04,557
She was willing to sacrifice the
lives of everyone in this world.

331
00:22:04,640 --> 00:22:05,937
Even her own.

332
00:22:06,020 --> 00:22:08,940
As long as she could save the six of you.

333
00:22:10,460 --> 00:22:12,317
She was protecting us.

334
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:16,280
As much as I hate to admit it, I
have no right to criticize her.

335
00:22:16,540 --> 00:22:19,580
If they find the blueprints
now, it's all my fault.

336
00:22:26,640 --> 00:22:27,940
Hey, what's wrong?

337
00:22:31,560 --> 00:22:33,277
I'm happy, that's all.

338
00:22:33,360 --> 00:22:34,840
I was so worried.

339
00:22:35,200 --> 00:22:37,612
I didn't want to believe she betrayed us.

340
00:22:40,060 --> 00:22:42,697
I gotta find everyone
else and let them know.

341
00:22:42,780 --> 00:22:44,780
Thank you, Iceberg. Hold on!

342
00:22:44,920 --> 00:22:45,897
What are you going to do now?

343
00:22:45,980 --> 00:22:48,274
The Straw Hats have already lost to CP9

344
00:22:48,720 --> 00:22:50,240
What do you mean we lost?

345
00:22:50,740 --> 00:22:52,577
We haven't even started fighting yet.

346
00:22:52,660 --> 00:22:55,836
We wouldn't be here right
now if we gave up that easy!

347
00:22:56,140 --> 00:22:58,375
Luffy will get Robin back, you'll see.

348
00:22:58,860 --> 00:23:01,220
We just needed motivation, that's all.

349
00:23:03,220 --> 00:23:05,338
Now that we know Robin needs saving?

350
00:23:05,800 --> 00:23:08,329
There's no limit to
what we can accomplish.

351
00:23:12,440 --> 00:23:13,270
Chopper!

352
00:23:13,440 --> 00:23:14,320
Great news!

353
00:23:14,820 --> 00:23:16,640
Come on, Chopper! Wake up!

354
00:23:16,760 --> 00:23:18,231
We have to find everyone!

355
00:23:18,660 --> 00:23:20,017
You can sleep when you're dead!

356
00:23:20,100 --> 00:23:23,337
We gotta get moving before
they take Robin away for good!

357
00:23:26,680 --> 00:23:27,860
Hey, Chopper.

358
00:23:28,140 --> 00:23:30,317
Go meet up with Luffy
and the others and tell

359
00:23:30,400 --> 00:23:32,757
them everything that happened
between us and Robin.

360
00:23:32,840 --> 00:23:35,428
I don't want you to
leave out a single word.

361
00:23:36,840 --> 00:23:39,780
As for me, let's just say I have a plan.

362
00:23:40,140 --> 00:23:41,497
I'll try to be careful.

363
00:23:41,580 --> 00:23:42,756
We'll meet up later.

364
00:23:47,060 --> 00:23:48,001
Something wrong?

365
00:23:48,720 --> 00:23:52,600
Do you think Robin
doesn't like us anymore?

366
00:23:57,980 --> 00:24:00,620
Chopper, let me share a secret with you.

367
00:24:03,640 --> 00:24:09,320
When a woman tells a lie,
a real man forgives her.

368
00:24:12,160 --> 00:24:16,395
Attention, all passengers boarding
today's final service to Enies Lobby.

369
00:24:16,520 --> 00:24:17,837
Due to the current water level,

370
00:24:17,920 --> 00:24:20,577
we will be departing from the
platform on the second floor.

371
00:24:20,660 --> 00:24:22,360
Boarding time is 11 p .m.

372
00:24:24,020 --> 00:24:25,417
Let's go see who they are.

373
00:24:25,500 --> 00:24:26,330
Yeah!

374
00:24:29,220 --> 00:24:32,102
This is a top-secret
operation we'll run in here.

375
00:24:32,520 --> 00:24:35,280
The agents must board in private. No fair.

376
00:24:42,700 --> 00:24:45,700
How considerate of you to
finally turn yourself in.

377
00:24:46,100 --> 00:24:48,159
Twenty years is a long time to run.

378
00:25:00,960 --> 00:25:02,360
Bingo.
